{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f3a9c1e-4b6d-4f2a-9e7b-1c5d2e8a7f30",
    "name": "QB Notify v2 — API pública (/v1)",
    "description": "API pública multi-tenant de **QB Notify v2** (el servicio Go), autenticada por HMAC-SHA256. El prefijo `/v1` de las rutas es el versionado de la propia API, no la versión del proyecto.\n\nEl pre-request script de la colección calcula la firma automáticamente y añade las cabeceras `X-QBN-Key-Id`, `X-QBN-Timestamp` y `X-QBN-Signature` a cada petición.\n\n**Configura en el environment:** `baseUrl`, `keyId`, `apiSecret` (con `make seed`: `demo-key` / valor de `SEED_API_KEY_SECRET`).\n\nGuía completa: `docs/API-INTEGRACION.md` del repositorio.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Firma HMAC de QB Notify: METHOD \\n PATH \\n QUERY_CANONICA \\n SHA256_HEX(BODY) \\n TIMESTAMP",
          "const keyId = pm.variables.get('keyId');",
          "const secret = pm.variables.get('apiSecret');",
          "if (!keyId || !secret) {",
          "    throw new Error('Configura keyId y apiSecret en el environment (ver docs/API-INTEGRACION.md)');",
          "}",
          "",
          "// Codificación equivalente a url.QueryEscape de Go (espacio -> '+').",
          "function goQueryEscape(s) {",
          "    return encodeURIComponent(s)",
          "        .replace(/[!'()*]/g, function (c) { return '%' + c.charCodeAt(0).toString(16).toUpperCase(); })",
          "        .replace(/%20/g, '+');",
          "}",
          "",
          "// Path resuelto (sin query) a partir de la URL completa.",
          "const resolvedUrl = pm.variables.replaceIn(pm.request.url.toString());",
          "const m = resolvedUrl.match(/^[a-z][a-z0-9+.-]*:\\/\\/[^\\/?#]+([^?#]*)/i);",
          "let path = (m && m[1]) || '/';",
          "path = path.split('?')[0];",
          "if (path === '') { path = '/'; }",
          "",
          "// Query canónica: claves ordenadas alfabéticamente, codificación Go.",
          "const params = pm.request.url.query.all()",
          "    .filter(function (q) { return !q.disabled && q.key; })",
          "    .map(function (q) {",
          "        return {",
          "            key: pm.variables.replaceIn(q.key),",
          "            value: pm.variables.replaceIn(q.value || '')",
          "        };",
          "    });",
          "params.sort(function (a, b) { return a.key < b.key ? -1 : (a.key > b.key ? 1 : 0); });",
          "const query = params.map(function (q) { return goQueryEscape(q.key) + '=' + goQueryEscape(q.value); }).join('&');",
          "",
          "// Body crudo con variables resueltas; se reescribe para que lo firmado == lo enviado.",
          "let body = '';",
          "if (pm.request.body && pm.request.body.mode === 'raw' && pm.request.body.raw) {",
          "    body = pm.variables.replaceIn(pm.request.body.raw);",
          "    pm.request.body.update({ mode: 'raw', raw: body });",
          "}",
          "",
          "const CryptoJS = require('crypto-js');",
          "const timestamp = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000).toString();",
          "const bodyHash = CryptoJS.SHA256(body).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
          "const stringToSign = [pm.request.method.toUpperCase(), path, query, bodyHash, timestamp].join('\\n');",
          "const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(stringToSign, String(secret)).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
          "",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-QBN-Key-Id', value: keyId });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-QBN-Timestamp', value: timestamp });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-QBN-Signature', value: signature });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
